    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Shipping Details API provides a comprehensive view of shipping options associated with items in a user's shopping cart. This API endpoint allows developers to retrieve a list of available shipping methods, estimated delivery times, and associated costs for ecommerce transactions. It is particularly useful for applications looking to enhance customer experience by presenting accurate and timely shipping information during the checkout process. Typical consumers include ecommerce platforms and mobile applications that facilitate online shopping.",
